# LEEAUTOX: TWO-PHASE HOMEPAGE PRELOADER, 3D STARTING-GRID EXPERIENCE AND HOMEPAGE REVEAL

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing LeeAutoX website with a premium, two-phase homepage introduction experience.

The experience consists of:

**PHASE 1: Branded Preloader**
A full-screen loading experience featuring the existing LeeAutoX visual identity, a numerical progress counter from 1% to exactly 100%, and sophisticated branding.

**PHASE 2: 3D Starting-Grid Experience**
A photorealistic, AAA-quality 3D automotive starting-grid sequence based on the complete specification supplied in Section 10.

**FINAL TRANSITION: Homepage Reveal**
Once the 3D sequence displays the word **GO**, the entire 3D experience must fade away smoothly, revealing the normal, existing LeeAutoX homepage underneath.

The preloader and 3D experience are temporary introductory layers. They must never replace, redesign, or permanently alter the actual website.

This is an enhancement to an existing working project. Your priority is to deliver the experience without breaking existing functionality.

