- Adaptive performance: `<PerformanceMonitor bounds={() => [40, 60]} />` toggling `degraded` state, `<AdaptiveDpr pixelated />`, responsive `dpr` (`[1, 2]` desktop, `[1, 1.85]` tablet, `[1, 1.75]` mobile, `[1, 1.25]` degraded), and `multisampling` (`4` desktop, `0` on mobile or degraded).
